/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 86 0 R
/T (Zoho Creator ships with analytics components that turn form records into visual summaries without any separate BI tool. A Dashboard page can combine summary tiles, pie and bar charts, and embedded reports in one view; individual reports can use colour formatting to highlight rows, cells or columns; and a Kanban report groups records into columns by a chosen field, giving a board-style view of status, category or document type. All of these read live data directly from the application's forms, so the visuals update automatically as records are added or changed.)
/E (Zoho Creator ships with analytics components that turn form records into visual summaries without any separate BI tool. A Dashboard page can combine summary tiles, pie and bar charts, and embedded reports in one view; individual reports can use colour formatting to highlight rows, cells or columns; and a Kanban report groups records into columns by a chosen field, giving a board-style view of status, category or document type. All of these read live data directly from the application's forms, so the visuals update automatically as records are added or changed.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
