/Title (Zoho Creator ships with analytics components that turn form records into visual summaries without any separate BI tool. A Dashboard page can combine summary tiles, pie and bar charts, and embedded reports in one view; individual reports can use colour formatting to highlight rows, cells or columns; and a Kanban report groups records into columns by a chosen field, giving a board-style view of status, category or document type. All of these read live data directly from the application's forms, so the visuals update automatically as records are added or changed.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 575 0 R
>>
endobj
584 0 obj
<<
/Title (Zia is the AI layer built into the Zoho ecosystem, including Creator. Within Creator, Zia-driven features assist application builders by suggesting appropriate chart types for a given report, helping auto-generate dashboard layouts from existing forms, and surfacing trends that would otherwise need manual analysis. Rather than requiring the developer to hand-code every chart, Zia-assisted suggestions speed up the process of turning a plain data table into a meaningful summary.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 576 0 R
>>
endobj
